# This repository tracks the Lewis Hamilton site only.
#
# Deny-by-default, then allow app/. Everything else in this working directory —
# the reference material it was studied against, the planning docs, the tooling
# used to produce them — stays local.

/*
!/.gitignore
!/app/

# Inside app/
app/node_modules/
app/dist/
app/*.log
app/*.err
app/.vite/

# The reference site's own helmet model, if it ever reappears here. It was used
# briefly as a stand-in and is not ours to redistribute. The supplied
# helmet.gltf/buffer.bin are tracked normally — this rule is narrow on purpose,
# an earlier blanket *.gltf/*.bin rule would have silently untracked those too.
app/public/assets/helmet/helmet.glb

.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
